    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d619">

                <pb facs="0697" n="685" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg685"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.01/3790: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting American Representative to the French
                        Committee of National Liberation at Algiers</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chapin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Algiers</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-16T10:00:00+02:00">May 16, 1944—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 16—8:12 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1581. Assembly in today’s debate continued from last Friday<anchor n="81"
                        xml:id="d619-f1"/> on foreign affairs unanimously passed resolution stating
                    that henceforth French Committee on National Liberation will be known as
                    Provisional Government of French Republic.<anchor n="82" xml:id="d619-f2"/>
                    Assembly had referred to FCNL as Provisional Government in past two sessions but
                    present step formalizes action and will probably force FCNL to ratify this
                    step.</p>
                <p>Further details follow in full report on Assembly session.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d619-f1" n="81" xml:id="d619-f1-content">
                <p>May 12.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d619-f2" n="82" xml:id="d619-f2-content">
                <p>The resolution was confirmed by the Committee on June 6, 1944.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
